    "raw": "Probability: 95%\n---\nAlright, let's compute \\( 2721960^2 \\) step-by-step.\n\n---\n\nWe can write:\n\n\\[\n2721960 = 2722000 - 40\n\\]\n\nNow square it:\n\n\\[\n(2722000 - 40)^2 = 2722000^2 - 2 \\cdot 2722000 \\cdot 40 + 40^2\n\\]\n\n---\n\n**Step 1: Compute \\(2722000^2\\)**\n\nFirst, \\(2722^2\\):\n\n\\[\n2722^2 = (2700 + 22)^2 = 2700^2 + 2 \\cdot 2700 \\cdot 22 + 22^2\n\\]\n\\[\n2700^2 = 7,290,000\n\\]\n\\[\n2 \\cdot 2700 \\cdot 22 = 5400 \\cdot 22 = 118,800\n\\]\n\\[\n22^2 = 484\n\\]\nSum:\n\\[\n7,290,000 + 118,800 = 7,408,800\n\\]\n\\[\n7,408,800 + 484 = 7,409,284\n\\]\n\nSince \\(2722000 = 2722 \\times 1000\\), squaring gives:\n\n\\[\n2722000^2 = 7,409,284 \\times 1,000,000 = 7,409,284,000,000\n\\]\n\n---\n\n**Step 2: Compute \\(2 \\cdot 2722000 \\cdot 40\\)**\n\nFirst, \\(2722000 \\cdot 40 = 108,880,000\\).\n\nMultiply by 2:\n\n\\[\n2 \\cdot 108,880,000 = 217,760,000\n\\]\n\n---\n\n**Step 3: Compute \\(40^2 = 1600\\)**\n\n---\n\n**Step 4: Combine**\n\n\\[\n2721960^2 = 7,409,284,000,000 - 217,760,000 + 1,600\n\\]\n\nFirst subtract:\n\n\\[\n7,409,284,000,000 - 217,760,000 = 7,409,066,240,000\n\\]\n\nThen add 1,600:\n\n\\[\n7,409,066,241,600\n\\]\n\n---\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{7409066241600}\n\\]\n\nAnswer: 7409066241600"
