^2\n\\]\n\\[\n= 7290000 + 118800 + 484 = 7409284\n\\]\n\nSo:\n\n\\[\n2722000^2 = 7409284 \\times 10^6 = 7409284000000\n\\]\n\nNow \\(2 \\cdot 2722000 \\cdot 40 = 80 \\cdot 2722000 = 217760000\\).\n\nAnd \\(40^2 = 1600\\).\n\nSo:\n\n\\[\n2721960^2 = 7409284000000 - 217760000 + 1600\n\\]\n\n\\[\n7409284000000 - 217760000 = 7409066240000\n\\]\n\nAdd 1600:\n\n\\[\n7409066241600\n\\]\n\nFinal answer:\n\nAnswer: 7409066241600  \nConfidence: 100%"
