    "raw": "Let's compute \\( 6199572^2 \\) step-by-step.\n\nWe can write \\( 6199572 = 6,200,000 - 428 \\).\n\nFirst, square \\( 6,200,000 \\):\n\n\\[\n6,200,000^2 = (62 \\times 10^5)^2 = 62^2 \\times 10^{10} = 3844 \\times 10^{10} = 38,440,000,000,000\n\\]\n\nNow compute \\( 2 \\times 6,200,000 \\times 428 \\):\n\n\\[\n2 \\times 6,200,000 = 12,400,000\n\\]\n\\[\n12,400,000 \\times 428 = 12,400,000 \\times (400 + 28)\n\\]\n\\[\n= 4,960,000,000 + 347,200,000 = 5,307,200,000\n\\]\n\nNow compute \\( 428^2 \\):\n\n\\[\n428^2 = (400 + 28)^2 = 160,000 + 2 \\times 400 \\times 28 + 784\n\\]\n\\[\n= 160,000 + 22,400 + 784 = 183,184\n\\]\n\nNow combine using \\( (a-b)^2 = a^2 - 2ab + b^2 \\):\n\n\\[\n6199572^2 = 38,440,000,000,000 - 5,307,200,000 + 183,184\n\\]\n\\[\n38,440,000,000,000 - 5,307,200,000 = 38,434,692,800,000\n\\]\n\\[\n38,434,692,800,000 + 183,184 = 38,434,692,983,184\n\\]\n\nSo the exact integer is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{38434692983184}\n\\]\n\nAnswer: 38434692983184  \nConfidence: 100%"
