reak 19625 into \\( 19000 + 625 \\).\n\n**Step 1:** Multiply by 19000.  \n\\( 5750809102 \\times 19000 = 5750809102 \\times 19 \\times 1000 \\).\n\n- \\( 5750809102 \\times 19 = 5750809102 \\times (20 - 1) \\)  \n= \\( 115016182040 - 5750809102 \\)  \n= \\( 109265372938 \\).\n\nNow multiply by 1000: \\( 109265372938000 \\).\n\n---\n\n**Step 2:** Multiply by 625.  \n\\( 625 = 5^4 \\), but easier: \\( 625 = \\frac{10000}{16} \\). So:\n\n\\( 5750809102 \\times 625 = \\frac{5750809102 \\times 10000}{16} \\).\n\nFirst multiply by 10000: \\( 57508091020000 \\).  \nNow divide by 16:  \n\\( 57508091020000 \\div 16 \\).\n\n- Divide by 2: 28754045510000  \n- Divide by 2 again: 14377022755000  \n- Divide by 2 again: 7188511377500  \n- Divide by 2 again: 3594255688750.\n\nSo \\( 5750809102 \\times 625 = 3594255688750 \\).\n\n---\n\n**Step 3:** Add results:  \n\\( 109265372938000 + 3594255688750 \\).\n\nLet's align:\n\n109,265,372,938,000  \n+ 3,594,255,688,750  \n= 112,859,628,626,750.\n\n---\n\nSo the product is \\( 112,859,628,626,750 \\).\n\n**Final check:** Approximate: \\( 5.75\\times10^9 \\times 1.9625\\times10^4 \\approx 1.128\\times10^{14} \\), matches.\n\n---\n\nAnswer: 112859628626750  \nConfidence: 100%\n---\nLet's compute step by step.\n\nWe need \\( 5750809102 \\times 19625 \\).\n\nFirst, note that:\n\n\\( 19625 = 19600 + 25 \\).\n\n**Step 1:** Multiply by 19600.  \n19600 = 196 \u00d7 100.\n\nFirst, \\( 5750809102 \\times 196 \\):\n\n- \\( 5750809102 \\times 200 = 1,150,161,820,400 \\)\n- Subtract \\( 5750809102 \\times 4 = 23,003,236,408 \\)\n\nSo:  \n\\( 1,150,161,820,400 - 23,003,236,408 = 1,127,158,583,992 \\).\n\nMultiply by 100: \\( 112,715,858,399,200 \\).\n\n**Step 2:** Multiply by 25.  \n25 = 100/4, so:  \n\\( 5750809102 \\times 100 = 575,080,910,200 \\)  \nDivide by 4: \\( 143,770,227,550 \\).\n\n**Step 3:** Add the two parts:\n\n\\( 112,715,858,399,200 + 143,770,227,550 = 112,859,628,626,750 \\).\n\nSo the result is:\n\nAnswer: 112859628626750  \nConfidence: 100%\n---\nLet's compute step by step.\n\nWe need:  \n5750809102 \u00d7 19625\n\nFirst, note that 19625 = 20000 \u2212 375.\n\nSo:\n\n5750809102 \u00d7 20000 = 115,016,182,040,000  \n(Since \u00d72 = 11,501,618,204, then \u00d710,000 = 115,016,182,040,000.)\n\nNow 5750809102 \u00d7 375:  \n375 = 400 \u2212 25.\n\n\u00d7400 = 5750809102 \u00d7 4 \u00d7 100 = 23,003,236,408 \u00d7 100 = 2,300,323,640,800.\n\n\u00d725 = 5750809102 \u00d7 100 / 4 = 575,080,910,200 / 4 = 143,770,227,550.\n\nSo \u00d7375 = 2,300,323,640,800 \u2212 143,770,227,550 = 2,156,553,413,250.\n\nNow subtract:  \n115,016,182,040,000 \u2212 2,156,553,413,250 = 112,859,628,626,750.\n\nLet me double-check by direct multiplication:\n\n5750809102 \u00d7 19625:\n\nBreak 19625 = 19000 + 625.\n\n\u00d719000 = \u00d719 \u00d7 1000:  \n5750809102 \u00d7 19 = 5750809102 \u00d7 20 \u2212 5750809102 = 115,016,182,040 \u2212 5,750,809,102 = 109,265,372,938.  \n\u00d71000 = 109,265,372,938,000.\n\n\u00d7625 = \u00d7(5/8 of 1000) \u2192 easier: \u00d7625 = \u00d7 (600 + 25).  \n\u00d7600 = 5750809102 \u00d7 6 \u00d7 100 = 34,504,854,612 \u00d7 100 = 3,450,485,461,200.  \n\u00d725 = 143,770,227,550 (from before).  \nSum: 3,450,485,461,200 + 143,770,227,550 = 3,594,255,688,750.\n\nAdd both parts:  \n109,265,372,938,000 + 3,594,255,688,750 = 112,859,628,626,750. Matches.\n\nFinal answer:\n\nAnswer: 112859628626750  \nConfidence: 100%"
