    "raw": "Let's compute step-by-step.\n\nWe want \\( 26030999 \\mod 802 \\).\n\nFirst, note \\( 802 = 2 \\times 401 \\).  \nWe can find the remainder mod 802 directly by long division.\n\n---\n\n**Step 1: Estimate quotient**  \n\\( 802 \\times 30000 = 24,060,000 \\)  \nDifference: \\( 26,030,999 - 24,060,000 = 1,970,999 \\).\n\n---\n\n**Step 2: Continue division**  \n\\( 802 \\times 2000 = 1,604,000 \\)  \nDifference: \\( 1,970,999 - 1,604,000 = 366,999 \\).\n\n---\n\n**Step 3: Continue**  \n\\( 802 \\times 400 = 320,800 \\)  \nDifference: \\( 366,999 - 320,800 = 46,199 \\).\n\n---\n\n**Step 4: Continue**  \n\\( 802 \\times 50 = 40,100 \\)  \nDifference: \\( 46,199 - 40,100 = 6,099 \\).\n\n---\n\n**Step 5: Continue**  \n\\( 802 \\times 7 = 5,614 \\)  \nDifference: \\( 6,099 - 5,614 = 485 \\).\n\n---\n\nSince \\( 485 < 802 \\), remainder is \\( 485 \\).\n\n---\n\nLet\u2019s double-check quickly:  \n\\( 802 \\times 32457 = 802 \\times (32000 + 457) \\)  \n= \\( 25,664,000 + 802 \\times 457 \\)  \n\\( 802 \\times 457 = 802 \\times (400 + 57) = 320,800 + 45,714 = 366,514 \\)  \nSum: \\( 25,664,000 + 366,514 = 26,030,514 \\)  \nDifference: \\( 26,030,999 - 26,030,514 = 485 \\). \u2705\n\n---\n\nAnswer: 485  \nConfidence: 100%"
