    "raw": "Probability: 85%\n---\nAlright, let's go step-by-step.\n\nWe want the remainder when \\( 26030999 \\) is divided by \\( 802 \\).\n\n---\n\n**Step 1: Estimate the quotient**\n\nFirst, note that \\( 802 \\times 30000 = 24,060,000 \\), which is less than \\( 26,030,999 \\).  \nLet's try \\( 802 \\times 32000 = 25,664,000 \\). Still less.  \nTry \\( 802 \\times 32500 = 26,065,000 \\), which is slightly more than \\( 26,030,999 \\).  \nSo the quotient is a bit less than 32500.\n\n---\n\n**Step 2: Try 32400**\n\n\\( 802 \\times 32400 = 802 \\times (32000 + 400) = 25,664,000 + 320,800 = 25,984,800 \\).  \nDifference: \\( 26,030,999 - 25,984,800 = 46,199 \\).\n\n---\n\n**Step 3: Divide the remainder further**\n\nNow \\( 46,199 \\div 802 \\):  \n\\( 802 \\times 50 = 40,100 \\), remainder \\( 6,099 \\).  \n\\( 802 \\times 7 = 5,614 \\), remainder \\( 485 \\).  \nSo \\( 46,199 = 802 \\times 57 + 485 \\).\n\n---\n\n**Step 4: Combine**\n\nSo \\( 26,030,999 = 802 \\times (32400 + 57) + 485 \\)  \nThat is \\( 802 \\times 32457 + 485 \\).\n\nThe remainder is \\( 485 \\).\n\n---\n\n**Step 5: Check**\n\n\\( 802 \\times 32457 = 802 \\times 32000 + 802 \\times 457 \\)  \n= \\( 25,664,000 + 366,514 \\) = \\( 26,030,514 \\).  \nAdd remainder 485: \\( 26,030,999 \\). Correct.\n\n---\n\nAnswer: 485"
