t term: 497.\n\nSum remainders: 204 + 147 = 351, +118 = 469, +497 = 966.\n\n966 mod 631 = 966 \u2212 631 = 335.\n\nMatches earlier long division.\n\n---\n\n**Final answer:**\n\nAnswer: 335"
