    "raw": "Let's compute \\( 5505293^2 \\) step-by-step.\n\nWe can use the identity:  \n\\[\n(a + b)^2 = a^2 + 2ab + b^2\n\\]  \nLet \\( a = 5,500,000 \\) and \\( b = 5,293 \\).\n\n---\n\n**Step 1:** \\( a^2 = (5,500,000)^2 \\)  \n\\( 5.5^2 = 30.25 \\), so  \n\\( (5,500,000)^2 = 30,250,000,000,000 \\).\n\n---\n\n**Step 2:** \\( 2ab = 2 \\times 5,500,000 \\times 5,293 \\)  \nFirst, \\( 5,500,000 \\times 5,293 = 5,500,000 \\times (5,000 + 293) \\)  \n= \\( 27,500,000,000 + 5,500,000 \\times 293 \\).  \n\nNow \\( 5,500,000 \\times 293 = 5,500,000 \\times (300 - 7) \\)  \n= \\( 1,650,000,000 - 38,500,000 = 1,611,500,000 \\).\n\nSo \\( 5,500,000 \\times 5,293 = 27,500,000,000 + 1,611,500,000 = 29,111,500,000 \\).\n\nMultiply by 2: \\( 58,223,000,000 \\).\n\n---\n\n**Step 3:** \\( b^2 = 5,293^2 \\)  \n\\( 5,293^2 = (5,300 - 7)^2 = 5,300^2 - 2 \\times 5,300 \\times 7 + 49 \\)  \n\\( 5,300^2 = 28,090,000 \\)  \n\\( 2 \\times 5,300 \\times 7 = 74,200 \\)  \nSo \\( 28,090,000 - 74,200 + 49 = 28,015,849 \\).\n\n---\n\n**Step 4:** Add them up:  \n\\( 30,250,000,000,000 + 58,223,000,000 = 30,308,223,000,000 \\)  \nAdd \\( 28,015,849 \\):  \n\\( 30,308,223,000,000 + 28,015,849 = 30,308,251,015,849 \\).\n\n---\n\n**Final Answer:**  \nAnswer: 30308251015849  \nConfidence: 100%"
