    "raw": "Probability: 95%\n---\nAlright, let's compute \\( 5505293^2 \\) step-by-step.\n\nWe can use the identity:\n\n\\[\n(a + b)^2 = a^2 + 2ab + b^2\n\\]\n\nLet\u2019s write \\( 5505293 \\) as \\( 5500000 + 5293 \\).\n\n---\n\n**Step 1: Assign values**\n\n- \\( a = 5,500,000 \\)\n- \\( b = 5,293 \\)\n\n---\n\n**Step 2: Compute \\( a^2 \\)**\n\n\\[\n5,500,000^2 = (55 \\times 10^5)^2 = 3025 \\times 10^{10} = 30,250,000,000,000\n\\]\n\n---\n\n**Step 3: Compute \\( 2ab \\)**\n\nFirst, \\( a \\times b = 5,500,000 \\times 5,293 \\).\n\nBreak it:  \n\\( 5,500,000 \\times 5,293 = 5,500,000 \\times (5,000 + 293) \\)\n\n- \\( 5,500,000 \\times 5,000 = 27,500,000,000 \\)\n- \\( 5,500,000 \\times 293 = 5,500,000 \\times (300 - 7) \\)  \n  \\( = 1,650,000,000 - 38,500,000 = 1,611,500,000 \\)\n\nSum: \\( 27,500,000,000 + 1,611,500,000 = 29,111,500,000 \\)\n\nNow multiply by 2:  \n\\( 2ab = 58,223,000,000 \\)\n\n---\n\n**Step 4: Compute \\( b^2 \\)**\n\n\\( 5,293^2 \\):\n\nFirst, \\( 5,293 = 5,300 - 7 \\).\n\n- \\( 5,300^2 = 28,090,000 \\)\n- Subtract \\( 2 \\times 5,300 \\times 7 = 74,200 \\)\n- Add \\( 7^2 = 49 \\)\n\nSo: \\( 28,090,000 - 74,200 + 49 = 28,015,849 \\)\n\n---\n\n**Step 5: Add them up**\n\n\\[\na^2 + 2ab + b^2 = 30,250,000,000,000 + 58,223,000,000 + 28,015,849\n\\]\n\nFirst sum: \\( 30,250,000,000,000 + 58,223,000,000 = 30,308,223,000,000 \\)\n\nThen add \\( 28,015,849 \\):\n\n\\( 30,308,223,000,000 + 28,015,849 = 30,308,251,015,849 \\)\n\n---\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{30308251015849}\n\\]\n\nAnswer: 30308251015849"
