    "raw": "Let's compute 5,505,293\u00b2 step by step.\n\nWe can write:\n\n5,505,293 = 5,500,000 + 5,293\n\nNow square:\n\n(5,500,000 + 5,293)\u00b2 = 5,500,000\u00b2 + 2 \u00d7 5,500,000 \u00d7 5,293 + 5,293\u00b2.\n\nFirst term:  \n5,500,000\u00b2 = (55 \u00d7 100,000)\u00b2 = 3025 \u00d7 10\u00b9\u2070 = 30,250,000,000,000.\n\nSecond term:  \n2 \u00d7 5,500,000 \u00d7 5,293 = 11,000,000 \u00d7 5,293.  \n5,293 \u00d7 11,000,000 = 5,293 \u00d7 11 \u00d7 1,000,000 = 58,223 \u00d7 1,000,000 = 58,223,000,000.\n\nThird term:  \n5,293\u00b2: 5,293 \u00d7 5,293.\n\n5,293 \u00d7 5,000 = 26,465,000  \n5,293 \u00d7 293 = 5,293 \u00d7 300 \u2212 5,293 \u00d7 7 = 1,587,900 \u2212 37,051 = 1,550,849.\n\nSum: 26,465,000 + 1,550,849 = 28,015,849.\n\nNow add all together:\n\n30,250,000,000,000  \n+ 58,223,000,000  \n= 30,308,223,000,000  \n\n+ 28,015,849  \n= 30,308,251,015,849.\n\nSo the exact square is **30,308,251,015,849**.\n\nAnswer: 30308251015849  \nConfidence: 100%\n---\nLet's compute \\( 5505293^2 \\) step by step.\n\nWe can write \\( 5505293 = 5,505,293 \\).\n\nLet\u2019s use the formula \\((a + b)^2\\) with \\(a = 5,500,000\\) and \\(b = 5,293\\).\n\n- \\(a^2 = 5,500,000^2 = 30,250,000,000,000\\)\n- \\(2ab = 2 \\times 5,500,000 \\times 5,293 = 11,000,000 \\times 5,293\\)  \n  \\(= 11,000,000 \\times 5,000 = 55,000,000,000\\)  \n  plus \\(11,000,000 \\times 293 = 3,223,000,000\\)  \n  sum = \\(58,223,000,000\\)\n- \\(b^2 = 5,293^2\\)  \n  \\(5,293^2 = (5,300 - 7)^2 = 28,090,000 - 74,200 + 49\\)? Wait, better:  \n  \\(5,300^2 = 28,090,000\\)? Let's check: \\(53^2 = 2809\\), add four zeros \u2192 \\(28,090,000\\) is correct for \\(5,300^2\\).  \n  \\(2 \\times 5,300 \\times 7 = 74,200\\), subtract, add \\(49\\):  \n  \\(28,090,000 - 74,200 + 49 = 28,015,849\\).\n\nNow sum up:\n\n\\(30,250,000,000,000 + 58,223,000,000 = 30,308,223,000,000\\)  \nAdd \\(28,015,849\\):  \n\\(30,308,223,000,000 + 28,015,849 = 30,308,251,015,849\\).\n\nSo the square is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{3030825