    "raw": "Probability: 95%\n---\nAlright, let's go step-by-step.\n\nWe want the remainder when \\( 73087744 \\) is divided by \\( 245 \\).\n\n---\n\n**Step 1 \u2013 Factor the divisor**  \n\\( 245 = 5 \\times 49 = 5 \\times 7^2 \\).\n\nWe can find the remainder modulo \\(245\\) by using the Chinese Remainder Theorem: find remainder mod \\(5\\) and mod \\(49\\), then combine.\n\n---\n\n**Step 2 \u2013 Mod 5**  \nA number mod 5 depends only on its last digit.  \nLast digit of \\(73087744\\) is 4, so:\n\n\\[\n73087744 \\equiv 4 \\pmod{5}\n\\]\n\n---\n\n**Step 3 \u2013 Mod 49**  \nWe can reduce the number mod 49.\n\nFirst, note \\( 73087744 \\). Let's do it stepwise.\n\nWe can use: \\( 100 \\equiv 2 \\pmod{49} \\) since \\(100 - 98 = 2\\).\n\nBreak \\(73087744\\) into chunks: \\( 73087744 = 7308 \\times 10000 + 7744\\)? Wait, better to do direct division.\n\nLet\u2019s do mod 49 directly:\n\nFirst, \\(49 \\times 1,000,000 = 49,000,000\\). Subtract from 73,087,744:\n\n\\(73,087,744 - 49,000,000 = 24,087,744\\).\n\nNow \\(49 \\times 500,000 = 24,500,000\\), too big. Try \\(49 \\times 400,000 = 19,600,000\\).\n\nSubtract: \\(24,087,744 - 19,600,000 = 4,487,744\\).\n\nNow \\(49 \\times 90,000 = 4,410,000\\).\n\nSubtract: \\(4,487,744 - 4,410,000 = 77,744\\).\n\nNow \\(49 \\times 1,500 = 73,500\\).\n\nSubtract: \\(77,744 - 73,500 = 4,244\\).\n\nNow \\(49 \\times 80 = 3,920\\).\n\nSubtract: \\(4,244 - 3,920 = 324\\).\n\nNow \\(49 \\times 6 = 294\\).\n\nSubtract: \\(324 - 294 = 30\\).\n\nSo remainder mod 49 is 30.\n\n---\n\n**Step 4 \u2013 Solve CRT**  \nWe have:\n\n\\[\nx \\equiv 4 \\pmod{5}\n\\]\n\\[\nx \\equiv 30 \\pmod{49}\n\\]\n\nFrom the second: \\(x = 30 + 49k\\).\n\nMod 5: \\(30 \\equiv 0\\), \\(49 \\equiv 4 \\pmod{5}\\).\n\nSo \\(0 + 4k \\equiv 4 \\pmod{5} \\Rightarrow 4k \\equiv 4 \\pmod{5}\\).\n\nMultiply inverse of 4 mod 5 (which is 4): \\(k \\equiv 16 \\equiv 1 \\pmod{5}\\).\n\nSo \\(k = 1 + 5t\\).\n\nThen \\(x = 30 + 49(1 + 5t) = 30 + 49 + 245t = 79 + 245t\\).\