63,438,193 = 382.\n\n---\n\n**Step 4: Check if remainder < 637.**  \n382 < 637, yes.\n\nSo remainder is 382.\n\n---\n\n**Final check:**  \n637 \u00d7 99,589 = 63,438,193, plus 382 = 63,438,575. Correct.\n\n---\n\nAnswer: 382  \nConfidence: 100%"
